<import src="../../templates/cards.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">SHIGUANG · FOOD GUIDE</view><view class="title">人间烟火<text class="accent">，</text>
<text>好好吃饭。</text></view><text class="hero-emoji">🍜</text><view class="subtitle">发现街角好味道，收藏生活的小确幸</view><view class="search"><text>⌕</text><input value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜一搜店名 / 火锅 / 奶茶" confirm-type="search"/><text wx:if="{{keyword}}" bindtap="clearSearch" class="clear">×</text></view></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="categories" enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="category {{category===item?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" data-category="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item}}</view></scroll-view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">今日觅食 <text class="accent">精选</text></view><text class="muted">{{foods.length}} 家好店等你发现</text></view><template is="cards" data="{{foods}}"/><view wx:if="{{!foods.length}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-art">🍽️</text><view class="empty-title">这份美味，还没找到</view><view class="subtitle">换个关键词，继续探索街角好味道吧</view><button class="primary" bindtap="clearSearch">查看全部店铺</button></view><view class="footer-note">认真吃饭 · 认真生活  /  本地模拟探店指南</view></view>
